    "name":  "Circular Slim LED Panel 6W 4CCT Select | OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835 - Cutout 73mm",
    "reference":  "PLR6WOSR-3CCT-91867",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our new range of \u003cstrong\u003eSlim Recessed LED Panels\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, the perfect solution for versatile, high-quality lighting. With color options between \u003cstrong\u003e2700K, 3000K, 4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e, this \u003cstrong\u003ecircular downlight\u003c/strong\u003e of \u003cstrong\u003e6W\u003c/strong\u003e equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835\u003c/strong\u003e offers exceptional luminosity for any commercial environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts modern design, 120º beam angle, and \u003cstrong\u003eNO FLICK driver\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee uniform flicker-free lighting with natural colors. Make your spaces stand out with this quality Recessed LED Panel!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlim Circular LED Panel 6W - CCT - OSRAM CHIP\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover our innovative \u003cstrong\u003eSlim Recessed LED Panels\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eCCT\u003c/strong\u003e technology, designed for versatility and quality. \u003cstrong\u003eSelectable colors: 2700K, 3000K, 4000K, and 5700K.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with renowned \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 chips\u003c/strong\u003e, guarantees exceptional brightness. 120º beam angle for uniform distribution. NO FLICK driver, \u003cstrong\u003eCRI +85\u003c/strong\u003e. Cutout 70mm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses: Leisure centers, shops, malls, hotels, restaurants, home.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty with technical data sheets.\u003c/p\u003e",
